  "evidencia": "Page: Liz Rose. Sentence: Liz Rose (born in Dallas, Texas) is an American country music songwriter best known for her work with Taylor Swift.\nPage: Liz Rose. Sentence: She has co-written twenty of Swift's officially-released songs and singles, including \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" and \"You Belong with Me,\" which won her and Swift a Grammy Award in 2010.\nPage: You Belong with Me. Sentence: \"You Belong with Me\" is a song performed by American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift.\nPage: Songs About Rain. Sentence: \"Songs About Rain\" is a song written by Pat McLaughlin and Liz Rose, and recorded by American country music artist Gary Allan.",
